                  <h1>
          Full text of "<a href="/details/atalanta-41-335-347">A catalogue of type specimens of the Tortricidae described by V. I. Kuznetzov from Vietnam and deposited in the Zoological Institute, St. Petersburg</a>"
        </h1>
        <h2 class="pull-right">
          <small><a href="/details/atalanta-41-335-347">See other formats</a></small>
        </h2>
        <br class="clearfix" clear="right"/>
      <pre>Atalanta 41 (3/4): 335-347, Wiirzburg (2010), ISSN 0171-0079 





A catalogue of type specimens of the Tortricidae described by 
V. I. KUZNETZOv from Vietnam and deposited in the 


Zoological Institute, St. Petersburg 
by 
SVETLANA V. NEDOSHIVINA 
received 4.XTI.2009 


Abstract: 67 species described by V. KuzNerzov from Vietnam are listed with short comments on the type series including descrip- 
tions of their labels. Colour images of the holotypes are given (col. pl. 7-9). Descriptions of 99 of five species are provided and their 
genitalia are figured. 


Zusammenfassung: 67 Arten die von V. Kuznetzov aus Vietnam beschrieben wurden, werden mit kurzen Kommentaren zur Ty- 
