In this paper I provide images of species described by Kuznetzov from Vietnam. All are listed in alphabetical order. For each spe- 

cies the following information is given: 

1. Original reference. 

2. Types: number of specimens included in the type series according to the original description and their labels. 

3. Comments: additional data concerning the type series and number of the type specimens actually deposited in the collection of 
ZISP. 

4. Distribution of the species according to the published data and the material deposited in ZISP and collected by V. KuzNnetzov, V. 
ZOLOTUHIN and the author of the present paper. 


If necessary, taxonomic notes are given also for several species. They include the principal works concerning the status of the species 
name, or transferring the species into another genus. In cases of taxonomic changes, the present status of the species is given based 
on recent publications. Descriptions of 9° of five species, unknown until now, are given in the taxonomic appendix under the list 
of KUZNETzov’s species. 


