label written in ink by Kuznetzov’s hand “N 14, Rhopobota svetlanae sp. n., holotype”. It was marked with a red standard label 
“HOLOTYPUS, Rhopobota svetlanae KuzNEtTzov, 2003” by us. Distribution: Known only from the type locality. 


