Penthostola tricolorana Kuznetzov, 2000, Zoosystematica Rossica 8 (2): 345, figs 3-4. 

Types: Holotype , S. Vietnam, prov. Gialai, Kannak, 600 m, 11.XI.1988, V. KuzNetzov leg. 

