Cydia tropicana Kuznetzovy, 1992, Entomologicheskoe Obozrenie 71 (4): 855, fig. 12. 
Types: Holotype 9, N. Vietnam, prov. Vinhphu, Tamdao, 12.IV.1986, V. KuzNETzov leg. 
