141, fig. A) with the following characters: cestum broader, dilated almost twice in proximal end, presence of sclerotized plate in 
antrum, antrum deeper, no prominences on ventral sides. Signum top not pointed, its base broader. 

Material: Paratype °, S. Vietnam, prov. Gialai-Kontum, Tramlap, 20 km N Buenluoi, 30.X1.1988, V. Kuznetzov leg. GS. 
SVN09064. 


